{"id":"5ae0edef6e43d09e","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-natural-exponentiation.md","title":"自然数幂","display":"df-natural-exponentiation — 自然数幂","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-natural-exponentiation","aliases":["18-df-natural-exponentiation","18-df-010"],"display":"df-natural-exponentiation — 自然数幂","depends_on":["[[18-df-natural-multiplication]]","[[18-df-primitive-recursive-terms]]"],"source_title":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_edition":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5","source_section":"2.1.5","source_printed_pages":"12","source_pdf_pages":"23","source_correspondence":"exercise-solution","source_statement_status":"checked-2026-10-13"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-natural-exponentiation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-natural-exponentiation</span><span>18-df-010</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-natural-exponentiation — 自然数幂"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4f01243612f7285e\" href=\"?note=4f01243612f7285e\" title=\"18-df-natural-multiplication\">18-df-natural-multiplication</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f04544345afa1f92\" href=\"?note=f04544345afa1f92\" title=\"18-df-primitive-recursive-terms\">18-df-primitive-recursive-terms</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_title","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5"},{"key":"source_section","html":"2.1.5"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"12"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"23"},{"key":"source_correspondence","html":"exercise-solution"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-2026-10-13"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mult},a_\\times\">\\(\\mathrm{Mult},a_\\times\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4f01243612f7285e\" href=\"?note=4f01243612f7285e\" title=\"18-df-natural-multiplication\">18-df-natural-multiplication</a>；函数项与求值见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f04544345afa1f92\" href=\"?note=f04544345afa1f92\" title=\"18-df-primitive-recursive-terms\">18-df-primitive-recursive-terms</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NatExp}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathrm{NatExp}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 用第二变量递归引入。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NatExp}(x,0)\\coloneqq1,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{NatExp}(x,y+1)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Mult}(\\mathrm{NatExp}(x,y),x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{NatExp}(x,0)\\coloneqq1,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{NatExp}(x,y+1)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Mult}(\\mathrm{NatExp}(x,y),x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a_{\\exp}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Rec}(C_1^1,\\operatorname{Sub}(a_\\times,P_3^3,P_2^3)),\n\\qquad\\mathrm{NatExp}(x,y)=\\operatorname{ev}(a_{\\exp},\\langle y,x\\rangle),\n\\qquad\\mathrm{NatExp}\\in\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a_{\\exp}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Rec}(C_1^1,\\operatorname{Sub}(a_\\times,P_3^3,P_2^3)),\n\\qquad\\mathrm{NatExp}(x,y)=\\operatorname{ev}(a_{\\exp},\\langle y,x\\rangle),\n\\qquad\\mathrm{NatExp}\\in\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Exercise 2.1.5 的自然数幂练习，包含约定 0^0=1。步函数参数置换与乘法节点相同；归纳核对递归方程。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-natural-multiplication","status":"resolved","id":"4f01243612f7285e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-natural-multiplication]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-primitive-recursive-terms","status":"resolved","id":"f04544345afa1f92","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-primitive-recursive-terms]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-natural-multiplication","status":"resolved","id":"4f01243612f7285e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$x,y\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\mathrm{Mult},a_\\times$ 见 [[18-df-natural-multiplication]]；函数项与求值见 [[18-df-primitive-recursive-terms]]。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-primitive-recursive-terms","status":"resolved","id":"f04544345afa1f92","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$x,y\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\mathrm{Mult},a_\\times$ 见 [[18-df-natural-multiplication]]；函数项与求值见 [[18-df-primitive-recursive-terms]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"x,y\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mult},a_\\times","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NatExp}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NatExp}(x,0)\\coloneqq1,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{NatExp}(x,y+1)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Mult}(\\mathrm{NatExp}(x,y),x).","display":true},{"tex":"a_{\\exp}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Rec}(C_1^1,\\operatorname{Sub}(a_\\times,P_3^3,P_2^3)),\n\\qquad\\mathrm{NatExp}(x,y)=\\operatorname{ev}(a_{\\exp},\\langle y,x\\rangle),\n\\qquad\\mathrm{NatExp}\\in\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_2.","display":true}],"bytes":1377,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-38","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-natural-exponentiation]]"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"乘法、指数、前驱分别见 [[../18-df-natural-multiplication]]、[[../18-df-natural-exponentiation]]、[[../18-df-natural-predecessor]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-57","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-natural-exponentiation]]"}],"outgoing":["4f01243612f7285e","f04544345afa1f92"]}